TI  - Deciphering Time-Dependent DNA Damage Complexity, Repair, and Oxygen Tension: A Mechanistic Model for FLASH-Dose-Rate Radiation Therapy.
AU  - Liew H
AU  - Mein S
AU  - Dokic I
AU  - Haberer T
AU  - Debus J
AU  - Abdollahi A
